   use to bug out in if we have a time of social crisis.)
-  with an airbag
-  Wear a seatbelt with a shoulder strap properly positioned
-  Stay home when drunks on the road -- major holidays, Fri/Sat evenings
-  Don't drive when distracted, sick, tired, drunk, etc.
-  Always drive with headlights on
-  Keep both hands on wheel at 10/2 positions, esp. at high-speeds
-  Keep vehicle well-maintained, esp. brakes and tires

